/**

@dir
@ingroup PovLibraries
@brief Source code of _OpenEXR_ 3rd party EXR library.

This directory contains a slightly adapted OpenEXR 3.3.4 source distribution,
and is part of the POV-Ray source distribution package.

@note
    This distribution of OpenEXR differs from the original in the omission of
    the overly complex cmake build implementation. Instead, we have simplified the
    folder tree to directly use the Microsoft Visual Studio .vcxproj build process.

Official OpenExr source distribution packages can be obtained via <https://openexr.com/>.

See `LICENSE` file in this directory for licensing information.

*/
